WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.790
- I introduce weird
tropical fruit to people

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.190
from every corner of the world.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.653
It's the most amazing thing.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.750
There's sugar apples, annoan.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.510
I got manzanos.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.240
Sapidilla, the sweetest fruit.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.100
It's like a pear with brown sugar.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.683
It's just a religious
experience eating this fruit.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.810
- [Narrator] This is Robert,

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:25.643
right here,

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.030
and here.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:29.923
Here he is,

00:00:30.936 --> 00:00:32.220
and here.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.860
- My name is Robert Moehling
and I own Robert Is Here.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.270
A little bit of a landmark
here for over 60 years.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.070
- [Narrator] At six years
old Robert started selling

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.020
regular produce.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.240
- [Robert] My dad was
farming down in South Florida

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.020
and he was not doin' as well
as could have been done.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.430
- [Narrator] So his dad put out a sign

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.950
that said Robert is here
as a marketing technique.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.880
And Robert is still here.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.800
Customers stopped for the cute kid

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.799
and stayed for the great fruit.

00:00:54.799 --> 00:00:57.311
- Dad kept on farming till I was about 14

00:00:57.311 --> 00:00:59.180
and then he sold all of his equipment

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.340
and didn't farm anymore.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.052
At about 14 I bought this property.

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:03.309
I worked on my farm,

00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:06.373
by myself doing most of the
tractor work and spraying

00:01:06.373 --> 00:01:07.660
and everything else.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:09.670
Now we have about 50 acres of land.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:10.503
Farm animanls.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.293
Booming fruit stand and a great crew.

00:01:14.686 --> 00:01:17.260
- [Narrator] Ever since a
neighbor introduced Robert

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:20.284
to fruits like papaya,
mango, and guanabana,

00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:22.980
Robert fell in love
with the exotic flavors

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:26.120
and wanted to share them with
anyone who came to his stand.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.660
- We have jackfruit,
canistel, mamoncillos,

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.970
which is a Spanish lime,
rambutan, lychees and langans.

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.340
Oh the guanabana.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.713
Gosh there's so many.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.980
- [Narrator] South Florida
is one of the only climates

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:42.130
that can grow so many tropical
fruits all in one place.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.599
Today Robert can sell up to
50 varieties at one time.

00:01:45.599 --> 00:01:48.510
- When it's in season
everything's grown right here.

00:01:49.932 --> 00:01:52.170
- [Narrator] What was once
a small operation is now

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.530
a family business.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:56.150
And for Robert sharing his
passion with his family

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:57.700
has made all the difference.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:59.628
- The whole family is on the market now.

00:01:59.628 --> 00:02:00.603
Runnin' in.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.460
I work really hard and I want my family

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.260
to work really hard and still have fun.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:11.260
My aim is to be the best farm
market ever on the planet

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:12.993
and I'm not far from it.

